{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Iron Dice is a grand strategy game set in a distant but not unfamiliar medieval world. Rule one of 60+ kingdoms, each with its own culture, history, and goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Economy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/fb414e6069e87166bd9a145e4e5658d1.poster.avif?t=1751650247\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/fb414e6069e87166bd9a145e4e5658d1.webm?t=1751650247\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 35 Unique trade goods with dynamic pricing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Primary, secondary, and tertiary economic sectors with chaining bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade province infrastructure and buildings for increased production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Charter companies to find and produce new goods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/0e49af5265cb12ca3c4ecd484ab38ab2.poster.avif?t=1751650247\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/0e49af5265cb12ca3c4ecd484ab38ab2.webm?t=1751650247\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raise armies and build navies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maneuver your men across hundreds of conquerable tiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your armies for defense, offense, speed, or all three</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></l